# Lead Cat core

- SaaS multi-tenant; one platform `BOT_TOKEN`; workspace config in Postgres only.
- Alpha deploy: Dokploy with Postgres + Redis + app (no external IdP).
- Auth: native JWT (`JWT_SECRET`); login via `/login` — see `lead-cat-auth.mdc`.
- Scenarios: n8n-like JSON (nodes/edges); asynq on Redis; no Temporal.
- UI: cat design mandatory — see `cat-design.mdc`.
- KISS / DRY / SOLID; Clean Architecture in Go (`backend/`); lite FSD in `frontend/`.
- Update `docs/*` when changing API, nodes, or env.
